---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const description =
  "Information about agreements, acceptable use, security responsibilities, and support for the ISECure WS Channel API.";
---

<Layout
  title="WS Channel API service terms | ISECure"
  lang="en"
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl="https://www.isecure.fi/ws-api-terms/"
  showLanguageSwitcher={false}
>
  <article class="terms-page container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Developer resources</p>
    <h1>WS Channel API service terms</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      WS Channel API access is provided under a customer- or partner-specific
      service agreement with ISECure Oy. That signed agreement, including any
      attached service description and data-processing terms, governs your use
      of the API.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Before using the API</h2>
      <p>
        Contact ISECure to obtain the applicable agreement and an integrator API
        key. API keys, identity tokens, passwords, private keys, and MFA secrets
        are confidential credentials. Keep them out of source control, browser
        logs, analytics, and support messages.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Responsible integration</h2>
      <p>
        Use the API only for the accounts, banks, and purposes covered by your
        agreement. Respect documented rate limits, validate responses, avoid
        unnecessary retries, and protect bank files and personal data according
        to applicable law and your security obligations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>
        Banks and upstream services can introduce delays or maintenance windows.
        API behavior, supported banks, and security requirements may evolve.
        Version-specific behavior is documented in the
        <a href="/wsapi_v2/">API reference</a> and its changelog.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Questions and support</h2>
      <p>
        For commercial terms or a copy of the agreement, contact
        <a href="mailto:sales@isecure.fi">sales@isecure.fi</a>. For integration
        support, contact
        <a href="mailto:support@isecure.fi">support@isecure.fi</a> and include the
        API request ID—not credentials or bank-file contents.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside>
      <strong>Important</strong>
      <p>
        This page is a practical summary and does not replace the signed service
        agreement between you and ISECure Oy.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-page {
    margin: 4rem auto;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: #087f72;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .lead {
    color: #52636b;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  section {
    border-top: 1px solid #dde5e8;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  a {
    color: #086f65;
    font-weight: 650;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  aside {
    border: 1px solid #b9ddd8;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #edfaf8;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
  }

  aside p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }
</style>
